Two parts of this folder are not covered by the licence above.

`Brain/matt/` holds literal copies of the `mattpocock-skills` package, written
by Matt Pocock and distributed under the MIT License. Its licence and credit
sit beside the files, in `Brain/matt/LICENSE` and `Brain/matt/CREDIT.md`.

The Brazilian Portuguese voices `pt_BR-miro-high` and `pt_BR-dii-high`, which
`npm run fetch-assets` downloads into `Resources/` and which are not part of
